        "comments": "The assembly lpMelUnif1.hap1.1 is based on 52x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The exact order and orientation of the scaffolds on chromosome 3 (268,313 ? 268,957 Kbp) are uncertain. The exact order and orientation of the scaffolds on chromosome 5 (17,223 ? 18,375 Kbp) are uncertain.",
